{"seq":1,"slug":"billing-cycle-statement-generation","title":"账期与账单生成：结算周期、账单结构与冻结/出账时点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-commission-fee-billing-settlement/billing-cycle-adjustment-dispute/billing-cycle-statement-generation","wordCount":2940,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"账期与账单生成-结算周期-账单结构与冻结-出账时点\">账期与账单生成：结算周期、账单结构与冻结/出账时点</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>费用分录（fee entry）落库之后，卖家看到的不是分录流，而是一张<strong>账单</strong>（statement / settlement report）。账单是账期这个「聚合窗口」的产物：把窗口内所有分录按卖家、站点、币种归集，扣除储备金冻结，加上前期结转，最终给出一个<strong>可提现金额</strong>（payout amount）。因此账单生成要回答三个彼此独立的问题——<strong>周期</strong>（何时切窗口）、<strong>结构</strong>（窗口内如何归集与结转）、<strong>时点</strong>（冻结何时扣、出账何时放）。</p>\n<p>卖家对账时看到的「金额对不上」，往往不是佣金算错了，而是账期边界、冻结规则、币种折算三个切面各自的时区/口径差异叠加出来的。工程上要把它们拆成三段流水线，各自可重放、可审计。</p>\n<p>Amazon 的 Settlement Reports、eBay 的 Payments 报表、Shopify Payments 的 payout、Stripe Connect 的 balance transaction，本质都是这条流水线的产品化形态，都把「账期」建模成一个<strong>有起止时间戳、按站点/币种切分、带期初/期末储备余额</strong>的账套。下文按工程视角重建它的通用模型。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[(费用分录&lt;br/&gt;append-only)] --&gt; B[账期切分&lt;br/&gt;按站点/币种/周期]&#10;    B --&gt; C[聚合与结转&lt;br/&gt;期初余额 + 本期净额]&#10;    C --&gt; D[冻结计算&lt;br/&gt;reserve hold / release]&#10;    D --&gt; E[账单生成&lt;br/&gt;statement header + lines]&#10;    E --&gt; F{出账条件&lt;br/&gt;cut-off 已过 &amp; 无 hold}&#10;    F --&gt;|满足| G[发起打款&lt;br/&gt;disbursement]&#10;    F --&gt;|未满足| H[挂账&lt;br/&gt;carry forward 至下期]&#10;    H --&gt; B\">graph TD\n    A[(费用分录&lt;br/&gt;append-only)] --&gt; B[账期切分&lt;br/&gt;按站点/币种/周期]\n    B --&gt; C[聚合与结转&lt;br/&gt;期初余额 + 本期净额]\n    C --&gt; D[冻结计算&lt;br/&gt;reserve hold / release]\n    D --&gt; E[账单生成&lt;br/&gt;statement header + lines]\n    E --&gt; F{出账条件&lt;br/&gt;cut-off 已过 &amp; 无 hold}\n    F --&gt;|满足| G[发起打款&lt;br/&gt;disbursement]\n    F --&gt;|未满足| H[挂账&lt;br/&gt;carry forward 至下期]\n    H --&gt; B</pre><p>账单的会计恒等式必须逐期闭合，这是审计与对账的地基：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>payout</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>carryIn</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>gross</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>refund</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>fee</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>adj</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mtext>reserve</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{payout}_{t} = \\text{carryIn}_{t} + \\text{gross}_{t} - \\text{refund}_{t} - \\text{fee}_{t} + \\text{adj}_{t} - \\Delta\\text{reserve}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8592em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payout</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">carryIn</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gross</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">refund</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fee</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">adj</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reserve</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>carryIn</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{carryIn}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">carryIn</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是上期未结清余额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mtext>reserve</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>hold</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>release</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\text{reserve}_t = \\text{hold}_t - \\text{release}_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reserve</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hold</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">release</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。任何一期的账单，只要改动其中一项而不同步调整其余项，恒等式立刻破裂——这就是「重算而非修改」约束在账单层的体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结算周期的建模-日历周期-滚动周期与账期锚点\">结算周期的建模：日历周期、滚动周期与账期锚点</h2><p>周期模型不是简单的「每 14 天」。主流平台实际存在三种模型，且常常混用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>周期模型</th>\n<th>切片方式</th>\n<th>典型采用者</th>\n<th>工程要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>日历固定周期</td>\n<td>自然周 / 半月 / 自然月</td>\n<td>Amazon（多数站点按 14 天结算）、Shopify Payments（按天/周/月可配）</td>\n<td>周期边界必须固定 TZ 与 cut-off 秒，否则每期边界漂移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滚动周期</td>\n<td>从首笔交易起 N 天为一期</td>\n<td>Stripe Connect（滚动日/周/月）、PayPal</td>\n<td>每卖家周期起点不同，聚合任务必须按卖家分组触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件驱动出账</td>\n<td>无固定周期，满足条件即出</td>\n<td>eBay Managed Payments 的部分 payout、平台自建「达到阈值即打款」</td>\n<td>阈值本身是费率/风控参数，需版本化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Amazon 把 settlement period 定义为带明确 <code>settlement-start-date</code> / <code>settlement-end-date</code> 的窗口，并在报告中给出 <code>deposit-date</code>；卖家通过 SP-API 的 <code>Finances</code> 接口或 Settlement Reports 取到这套时间戳。一个常被忽略的细节是：<strong>账期时间戳用 UTC 还是站点本地时间，各平台并不统一</strong>。跨境卖家同时经营美国、欧洲、日本站点时，若引擎混用本地时间切分，同一笔订单可能落进两个相邻账期，或在边界处丢失。</p>\n<p><strong>建议的工程约束：</strong> 账期内部分录一律以 UTC 存储与切分；只在账单展示层按站点时区渲染「账期起止」，并把展示时区写进账单 header，使账单可自我解释。账期的切分键是复合的：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>periodKey</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>sellerId</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>marketplaceId</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>currency</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>periodStart</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>periodEnd</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>scheduleVersion</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{periodKey} = (\\text{sellerId}, \\text{marketplaceId}, \\text{currency}, \\text{periodStart}, \\text{periodEnd}, \\text{scheduleVersion})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">periodKey</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sellerId</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">marketplaceId</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">currency</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">periodStart</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">periodEnd</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scheduleVersion</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把 <code>scheduleVersion</code> 放进切分键，是为在平台调整结算频率（从月结改为双周结、或对新卖家缩短周期）时，历史账期不被新规则重新切分。这与计费引擎里费率卡版本化的理由一致：见 <code>../2_fee-calculation-charge-engine/1_charge-engine-architecture-idempotency.md</code> 中关于规则版本与幂等键的讨论。</p>\n<p>汇率的取值时点同为账期属性。账期内多币种收入折算进结算币种，用<strong>账期期末汇率</strong>还是<strong>逐笔交易日汇率</strong>，会直接改变账单金额。Amazon、Shopify 等通常按账期维度用一个结算汇率，而会计上更严谨的做法是逐笔按交易日汇率折算、汇兑差异单独成行（FX gain/loss line）。两种口径都合理，但必须在账单 header 里声明。取整与舍入规则在此同样敏感，见 <code>../1_charge-basis-rate-card-engine/3_rounding-allocation-currency-precision.md</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"账单结构的账务建模-从分录到账单行\">账单结构的账务建模：从分录到账单行</h2><p>账单不是分录的平铺列表。它是一棵树：<strong>账单头（header）→ 费用类目分组（fee category）→ 账单行（statement line）→ 分录明细（entry detail）</strong>。分组维度决定了卖家能否一眼看懂，也决定了后续对账能否按类目核对。</p>\n<p>Amazon 的 Settlement Report 用 <code>settlement-id</code>、<code>transaction-type</code>、<code>order-id</code>、<code>amount-type</code>、<code>amount-description</code>、<code>amount</code>、<code>posted-date</code> 等字段表达这套层级；<code>amount-type</code>（ItemPrice / ItemFees / Promotion / Other）是第一层分组，<code>amount-description</code>（Principal、Commission、ShippingChargeback…）是第二层。自建引擎时，建议把「费用类目」抽成稳定枚举，而非沿用各渠道的原始字符串——这正是防腐层的价值。</p>\n<p>一个可用的账单行结构至少包含：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>账单行字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>line_type</code></td>\n<td>行类型（交易/费用/调账/储备/结转）</td>\n<td><code>sale</code>、<code>commission</code>、<code>adjustment</code>、<code>reserve</code>、<code>carry</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>category</code></td>\n<td>费用类目</td>\n<td><code>referral_fee</code>、<code>payment_processing</code>、<code>fulfillment</code>、<code>storage</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>source_ref</code></td>\n<td>关联的订单/退款/案件号</td>\n<td><code>order_id</code>、<code>refund_id</code>、<code>case_id</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>entry_ids</code></td>\n<td>本行汇总的底层分录</td>\n<td><code>[e1, e2, ...]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sign</code></td>\n<td>借贷方向</td>\n<td><code>+1</code> / <code>-1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>amount</code>, <code>currency</code></td>\n<td>金额与币种（结算币种）</td>\n<td><code>-12.35 USD</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>posted_at</code>, <code>period</code></td>\n<td>入账时点与所属账期</td>\n<td>UTC 时间戳</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键是 <strong><code>entry_ids</code> 的保留</strong>。若账单行只存汇总金额，卖家对一个「仓储费 $48.20」提出争议时，平台无法回溯它由哪几条分录构成，只能重算整期——而重算结果若与原始不同（费率卡已更新），争议就成了无法收敛的死循环。保留分录引用，让账单行可<strong>下钻</strong>到不可变的历史分录，是争议可裁决的前提。</p>\n<p>账单生成还有一条一致性约束：<strong>同一账期的账单一旦发出就不应改变</strong>。允许更正的做法是发行一份<strong>补充账单</strong>（supplementary / adjustment statement），引用原账单号并只列差异；直接改写已发出的账单，会让卖家端账目与平台端永久分叉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冻结与出账时点-cut-off-储备金与打款\">冻结与出账时点：cut-off、储备金与打款</h2><p>冻结（reserve / hold）是账单生成中最易被卖家误解、也最易引发工单的部分。它分两类，语义完全不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>交易级冻结（deferred / pending transaction）</strong>：某笔具体交易因风险或时效未满足条件（买家尚未确认收货、退货窗口未过）而暂不计入可提现余额。</li>\n<li><strong>账户级储备（account-level reserve / rolling reserve）</strong>：平台按一定比例或固定金额，从每期可提现额中留存一部分作为风险缓冲，通常滚动释放。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Amazon 的账户级储备金（Account Level Reserve）显示为「当前储备」与「即将释放」，并在结算报告里以 <code>reserve</code> 行体现；Stripe Connect 提供 rolling reserve 与 minimum balance 配置；PayPal 对新卖家常设 21 天资金持有；eBay Managed Payments 对有风险的卖家设置 payout on hold。机制形态不同，但都是同一个会计动作：<strong>把「已赚取」与「可提取」两个概念分开</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>withdrawable</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>accrued</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>deferred</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>reserveHeld</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>reserveReleased</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{withdrawable}_{t} = \\text{accrued}_{t} - \\text{deferred}_{t} - \\text{reserveHeld}_{t} + \\text{reserveReleased}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">withdrawable</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">accrued</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">deferred</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reserveHeld</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reserveReleased</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>账期引擎必须把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>deferred</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{deferred}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">deferred</span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>reserveHeld</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{reserveHeld}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reserveHeld</span></span></span></span></span></span> 分开建模，而非合成一个「冻结金额」数字：(1) 释放条件不同（交易级随事实达成释放，账户级按滚动窗口比例释放）；(2) 交易级冻结在争议升级时可能变成扣款，账户级储备一般只是延迟支付；(3) 现金流预测依赖两者的账龄分布。</p>\n<p>出账时点（disbursement）取决于两个独立条件同时满足：<strong>账期已 cut-off</strong> 且 <strong>资金不在冻结状态</strong>。cut-off 是账期边界的量化定义，含三要素：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>录入截止时刻</strong>：晚于此到达的分录归入下一账期，即使业务事实发生在本期。这是必要妥协——账期必须能在有限时间内闭合。</li>\n<li><strong>数据完整性水位（watermark）</strong>：聚合任务须确认上游事件（订单、退款、物流）已推进到足够水位，避免账单发出后才补分录。实践中用「事件时间水位 + 容忍延迟窗口」表达。</li>\n<li><strong>跨系统对账前置</strong>：账期关闭前应完成与支付通道、物流商的基础对账，否则账单会带着未核实金额发出。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>cut-off 之后到打款之间还有一个<strong>可撤销窗口</strong>。ACH、SEPA、本地钱包清结算并非即时终局（ACH 有 return 窗口，SEPA 有 recall 机制），平台通常在账单与打款之间保留缓冲期以吸收通道侧回退。这段时间在卖家侧表现为「已出账、待打款」。</p>\n<p>一个完整的账单状态机大致如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[OPEN&lt;br/&gt;累积分录] --&gt; B[CUT_OFF&lt;br/&gt;停止录入]&#10;    B --&gt; C[LOCKED&lt;br/&gt;冻结计算完成]&#10;    C --&gt; D[ISSUED&lt;br/&gt;账单已发布]&#10;    D --&gt; E{打款条件}&#10;    E --&gt;|满足| F[PAID&lt;br/&gt;已打款]&#10;    E --&gt;|冻结未释放| G[HELD&lt;br/&gt;挂账]&#10;    G --&gt; E&#10;    F --&gt; H[SETTLED&lt;br/&gt;通道确认终局]&#10;    H --&gt; I[CLOSED]\">graph TD\n    A[OPEN&lt;br/&gt;累积分录] --&gt; B[CUT_OFF&lt;br/&gt;停止录入]\n    B --&gt; C[LOCKED&lt;br/&gt;冻结计算完成]\n    C --&gt; D[ISSUED&lt;br/&gt;账单已发布]\n    D --&gt; E{打款条件}\n    E --&gt;|满足| F[PAID&lt;br/&gt;已打款]\n    E --&gt;|冻结未释放| G[HELD&lt;br/&gt;挂账]\n    G --&gt; E\n    F --&gt; H[SETTLED&lt;br/&gt;通道确认终局]\n    H --&gt; I[CLOSED]</pre><p>每一状态的跃迁都应携带完整审计快照（谁在何时以何规则关闭账期）。资金类系统的审计要求通常来自适用法规——例如欧盟 DAC7 指令要求平台向税务机关报告卖家收入数据，美国 IRS 1099-K 的申报门槛近年多次调整（《American Rescue Plan Act》将法定门槛降至 $600，IRS 以过渡期公告分阶段推迟）。这些申报都以<strong>已关闭账期的账单</strong>为准，因此账单一旦发出，其状态跃迁必须留痕、不可静默修改；申报门槛参数应参数化、版本化，而非硬编码在账单逻辑里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时区-币种与边界的三个一致性陷阱\">时区、币种与边界的三个一致性陷阱</h2><p>把这些机制串起来时，最容易在生产环境翻车的三个点值得单列：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>DST 陷阱</strong>：账期用站点本地时间表达时，夏令时切换会让某一期实际时长变成 23 或 25 小时，边界处的分录归属随之改变。用 UTC 切分可规避，但展示层仍需按规则还原本地时间。</li>\n<li><strong>零金额账期</strong>：某卖家某站点当期无任何分录，是「不生成账单」还是「生成一张金额为零的账单」？两者税务与审计含义不同；生成零账单利于账套连续性，但增加存储与卖家端噪音，实践中通常按「有余额或前期有结转才生成」处理。</li>\n<li><strong>币种非结算币</strong>：卖家以 USD 注册、经营 EUR 站点时，账期是「按结算币种合并所有站点」还是「按站点币种分别出账」？Amazon、Shopify 等通常按注册地结算币种合并并给出折算汇率，与会计按站点分账的口径不同，必须在账单 header 显式声明。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这三个陷阱的共同解法是同一条原则：<strong>账期的每个边界条件都必须是显式参数，并写进账单元数据</strong>。任何靠「约定俗成」隐式承载的规则，都会在跨站点、跨时区、跨币种场景下退化为对账工单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>账单生成是三段可独立重放的流水线：<strong>账期切分 → 聚合结转 → 冻结与出账</strong>，其恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>payout</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>carryIn</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>gross</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>refund</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>fee</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>adj</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>reserve</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{payout} = \\text{carryIn} + \\text{gross} - \\text{refund} - \\text{fee} + \\text{adj} - \\Delta\\text{reserve}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payout</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">carryIn</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gross</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">refund</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fee</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">adj</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reserve</span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须逐期闭合。</li>\n<li>结算周期存在日历固定、滚动、事件驱动三种模型；切分键需包含 <code>sellerId</code>、<code>marketplaceId</code>、<code>currency</code>、<code>periodStart/End</code> 与 <code>scheduleVersion</code>，并在 UTC 上切分、只在展示层还原本地时区。</li>\n<li>账单结构是一棵 header → category → line → entry 的树，账单行必须保留 <code>entry_ids</code> 以便下钻到不可变分录；已发出的账单只能通过补充账单更正。</li>\n<li>冻结要区分交易级（deferred）与账户级（reserve），二者释放条件与会计含义不同，不能合并成一个数字。</li>\n<li>出账时点 = 账期 cut-off 已过 <strong>且</strong> 资金未被冻结；cut-off 由录入截止、数据水位、跨系统对账前置三要素共同定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"账期与账单生成：结算周期、账单结构与冻结/出账时点","id":"账期与账单生成-结算周期-账单结构与冻结-出账时点"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"结算周期的建模：日历周期、滚动周期与账期锚点","id":"结算周期的建模-日历周期-滚动周期与账期锚点"},{"level":2,"text":"账单结构的账务建模：从分录到账单行","id":"账单结构的账务建模-从分录到账单行"},{"level":2,"text":"冻结与出账时点：cut-off、储备金与打款","id":"冻结与出账时点-cut-off-储备金与打款"},{"level":2,"text":"时区、币种与边界的三个一致性陷阱","id":"时区-币种与边界的三个一致性陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"退款退货的费用冲销与按比例分摊：部分退、跨期退与费用回收","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-commission-fee-billing-settlement/fee-calculation-charge-engine/refund-reversal-proration"},"next":{"title":"调账与贷记单：补扣、减免、追溯费率变更的会计与审批控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-commission-fee-billing-settlement/billing-cycle-adjustment-dispute/adjustment-credit-note-policy"}}